<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back further 762,050 shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back further 762,050 shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand on Tuesday bought back a further 762,050 shares at prices between NZ$6.58 and $6.63, continuing its NZ$1 billion buyback programme, the New Zealand Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Telecom closed 10 cents lower at $6.60 on turnover worth NZ$37.4 million, more than a third of the total market volume of $98.6 million. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
